<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westvaco Corp upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westvaco Corp upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter raised its rating on Westvaco Corp to buy from accumulate, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- Westvaco gained 1/8 to 29-3/4 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
